      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-28T18:55:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I thought not.   I’m not entirely sure though.  If he does keep playing villan cards,  how and what does he play?   I mean,  he’s no longer available for flipping, so does he play 2 a turn?  1 a turn?   1 + 1 from the trash?   Presuemeably killing Omnitron removes the added difficulties of his advanced mode?   I’ve wondered about this myself, but it hasnt really made huge amounts of difference.</p>",
