      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/71c47a/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-28T22:32:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Until we get an official ruling I’ll play that once he is destroyed everything but the devices in play get removed including the deck. My theory is that if the heroes destroy omnitron but leave his devices behind thinking that they pose no threat would allow the devices to put him back together.</p>",
