      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/{size}/2710_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-29T02:18:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If we’re thinking of it from a story perspective (contrary to the other thread debating Wrest the Mind), Omnitron is the one actively creating the drones and components. After Omnitron itself is dead, it wouldn’t be able to make more.</p>",
